{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103260","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103260/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103260/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103260/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103260","id":2876111346,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6rbfny","number":103260,"title":"MultiMesh Stride width for TRANSFORM_2D incorrect","user":{"login":"thygrrr","id":8904620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDQ2MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8904620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr","html_url":"https://github.com/thygrrr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thygrrr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-24T20:45:47Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T13:12:00Z","closed_at":"2025-12-02T13:11:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4-rc1\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.4-rc1\n\n### Issue description\n\nA change a couple weeks back to scene/resources/multimesh.cpp in Commit e1af7b65b28087f9251eda03a3327e1313c9b51d has introduced a calculation for the stride width in the PackedFloat32Array.\n\nHowever, I believe the 2D size of \"8\" floats is a bug; a Transform2D is only 6 floats (3 columns of Vector2).\n\nThis seemingly leads to uninitialized or corrupted memory (visible in editor when setting a non-zero size),\nand also at runtime presenting considerable difficulty setting these buffers from C# (e.g. from an `Transform2D[ ]` array marshalled to `float[ ]`).\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4aad128a-1d2b-4a49-ba83-22693b7487a4)\n\n\n _Originally posted by @thygrrr in [e1af7b6](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/e1af7b65b28087f9251eda03a3327e1313c9b51d#r152944665)_\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a MultiMeshInstance2D.\n2. Set the Instance Count to 1000\n3. Observe the array being 8000 floats instead of 6000 floats\n4. Observe (sometimes) corrupt data in array; often only close to the end.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[repro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18949786/repro.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https: